<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(breadcrumbSchema)}></script>

  <section class="hub-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Residential Outdoor · Patio Heater Brands · LA Estates + Coast · Same Day</p>
      <h1>Outdoor Patio Heater Brands We Service in LA</h1>
      <p class="hub-lede">Patio heaters keep outdoor restaurant dining, hotel rooftops, and luxury residential patios comfortable through LA's cool nights — a longer-than-most-cities patio season makes maintenance critical here. Six brands cover most service load: Infratech (Burbank-made electric infrared since 1965 — the LA luxury standard), Bromic (Australian gas premium — hotel rooftops + Beverly Hills/Malibu estates), Sunpak (Texas gas commercial since 1957), Schwank (90+ year German/Canadian commercial), Solaira (Canadian electric infrared), and AEI / Indeeco (institutional infrared element banks).</p>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href={phoneHref} class="btn-primary">Call {phone}</a>
        <a href="/book/" class="btn-secondary">Book Online</a>
      </div>
      <p class="hub-foot">$89 commercial diagnostic · Applied to repair · BHGS #A49573 · EPA 608 Universal #1346255700410 · BBB Accredited</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hub-section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>6 outdoor patio heater brands we work on</h2>
      <p><strong>When a patio heater fails at an LA-area property, our techs at Same Day Appliance Repair trace it to a handful of patterns: on gas units (Bromic, Sunpak, Schwank) it's usually a thermocouple or pilot-ignition fault, gas-valve service, or wind-related flame instability; on electric infrared units (Infratech, Solaira, AEI/Indeeco) it's element burnout after summer dormancy, controller issues, or wiring degradation in coastal salt air. Infratech specifically is Burbank-made, so our techs at Same Day Appliance Repair keep Comfort/Motif/CD element replacements on the truck for the common sizes. $89 commercial diagnostic, applied to repair. BHGS #A49573, EPA 608 Universal certified (#1346255700410), BBB Accredited.</strong></p>
      <div class="brand-grid">
        <a href="/outdoor/patio-heater-repair/brands/aei/" class="brand-card">
          <h3>AEI</h3>
          <p>AEI / Indeeco commercial infrared patio heater repair across SoCal. Multi-element bank repair.</p>
          <span class="card-cta">AEI repair details →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/outdoor/patio-heater-repair/brands/bromic/" class="brand-card">
          <h3>Bromic</h3>
          <p>Bromic patio heater repair across SoCal. Hotel rooftops + BH/Malibu luxury.</p>
          <span class="card-cta">Bromic repair details →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/outdoor/patio-heater-repair/brands/infratech/" class="brand-card">
          <h3>Infratech</h3>
          <p>Infratech patio heater repair across SoCal. Made in Burbank since 1965.</p>
          <span class="card-cta">Infratech repair details →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/outdoor/patio-heater-repair/brands/schwank/" class="brand-card">
          <h3>Schwank</h3>
          <p>Schwank gas patio heater repair across SoCal. 90+ year German/Canadian commercial heritage.</p>
          <span class="card-cta">Schwank repair details →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/outdoor/patio-heater-repair/brands/solaira/" class="brand-card">
          <h3>Solaira</h3>
          <p>Solaira patio heater repair across SoCal. Cosmo, Alpha, ICR electric infrared.</p>
          <span class="card-cta">Solaira repair details →</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/outdoor/patio-heater-repair/brands/sunpak/" class="brand-card">
          <h3>Sunpak</h3>
          <p>Sunpak gas patio heater repair across SoCal. Texas-made gas specialist since 1957.</p>
